                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "one of the best games i've ever played honestly.\r\n\r\nother games give you ptsd, this one has you live with it.\r\n\r\nwhat's up with this knight and the monsters? what is the knight running from? how come they can fly? no answers given and none are needed.\r\n\r\n2 button gameplay, 0 unnecessary lore, killer music and minimalistic yet uniqe visual design  - a perfect arcade game for me - a knight to remember as they say\r\n\r\nfair warning - one of the steam achievements is broken as of 2026",
